<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Balloon Blaster '95</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Press+Start+2P&family=VT323&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
  html,body { width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden; background:#000; }
  #wrap { position:fixed; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
  canvas { image-rendering:pixelated; cursor:crosshair; }
  .overlay {
    position:fixed; inset:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:28px;
    background:rgba(10,10,30,.82); z-index:10;
    font-family:'Press Start 2P', monospace; color:#fff; text-align:center;
  }
  .overlay h1 { font-size:clamp(22px,5vw,44px); color:#ffd23f; text-shadow:4px 4px 0 #b33, 8px 8px 0 #222; letter-spacing:2px; }
  .overlay p { font-family:'VT323',monospace; font-size:clamp(18px,2.6vw,26px); color:#cfe8ff; line-height:1.5; }
  .overlay .big { font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,38px); color:#ff5d5d; }
  .btn {
    font-family:'Press Start 2P',monospace; font-size:clamp(14px,2vw,20px);
    padding:18px 34px; color:#111; background:#ffd23f; border:4px solid #fff;
    box-shadow:0 8px 0 #a06a00, 0 12px 0 #333; cursor:pointer;
  }
  .btn:active { transform:translateY(6px); box-shadow:0 2px 0 #a06a00, 0 4px 0 #333; }
  .hidden { display:none !important; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="wrap"><canvas id="c"></canvas></div>
<div class="overlay" id="startScr">
  <h1>BALLOON BLASTER '95</h1>
  <p>Hold the mouse to draw the bow, aim with the cursor.<br>
     Release to shoot. Pop 15 balloons to win!<br>
     Miss 3 times and the level is lost.</p>
  <button class="btn" id="startBtn">START</button>
</div>
<div class="overlay hidden" id="endScr">
  <h1 id="endTitle">YOU WIN!</h1>
  <p id="endText"></p>
  <button class="btn" id="againBtn">PLAY AGAIN</button>
</div>
